  "bio": "Sofiya Belousova is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Ipswich, United Kingdom, specializing in the intricate styles of dotwork, black & gray, and fineline. Renowned for turning skin into canvas, Sofiya's detail-oriented work is a testament to her dedication and talent in the custom blackwork tattoo scene. Her professionalism is evident with every piece of art she creates, ensuring each client's experience at Abrakadavra Tattoo is exceptional and memorable.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Ipswich, England, United Kingdom\n\n..You are the art, I’m just decorating..\n@abrakadavra.studio U.K.\nDM or email to book\n@killerinktattoo @fadetheitch\n•@sofiyabelousova.personal•",
